==English==

===Etymology===
From {{affix|en|mark|-s-|man}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|/ˈmɑɹksmən/|lang=en}}
* {{hyphenation|marks|man|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|marksmen}}

# A man or person skilled at hitting [[target]]s, as with a [[firearm]], [[bow]], or [[throw]]n object.
# {{lb|en|soccer}} [[goalscorer|Goalscorer]].
